#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the autonomous oversight layer that monitors,
#    routes, and escalates all ARKA engines.
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    • Registers engines and escalation handlers
#    • Performs asynchronous health sweeps
#    • Routes commands to engines
#    • Handles engine failures
#    • Executes escalation workflows
#    • Maintains engine health state
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    register_engine(name, handler)
#       → Registers an engine with the supervisor.
#
#    register_escalation(code, handler)
#       → Registers an escalation handler.
#
#    sweep()
#       → Performs global health check across all engines.
#
#    escalate(code, payload)
#       → Routes escalation to the correct handler.
#
#    route(engine, command, payload)
#       → Sends command to a specific engine.
